Subject: [flux] Build //chrome/browser/flux into the WebUI configs target

chrome_web_ui_configs.cc references FluxUIConfig, so the source_set that owns
it needs the dependency. This is deliberately NOT a dep of the monolithic
chrome/browser target - that target no longer exists as such, and the configs
target is the minimal correct place.

diff --git a/chrome/browser/ui/webui/BUILD.gn b/chrome/browser/ui/webui/BUILD.gn
--- a/chrome/browser/ui/webui/BUILD.gn
+++ b/chrome/browser/ui/webui/BUILD.gn
@@ -54,6 +54,7 @@ source_set("configs") {
     ":webui",
     "//chrome/browser/actor/ui:actor_overlay",
     "//chrome/browser/contextual_tasks:ui",
+    "//chrome/browser/flux",
     "//chrome/browser/glic",
     "//chrome/browser/glic:impl",
